# Workspace Rules for Mini-Foot Tactical & Roster Manager

## Documentation Compliance
- All code MUST align with `docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.md`, `docs/PRD.md`, and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- New features require PRD updates before implementation
- Schema changes require ARCHITECTURE.md updates before migration

## Tech Stack (Defined by Architecture)
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express + TypeScript
- **Database**: PostgreSQL (via Prisma ORM)
- **Auth**: JWT with bcrypt
- **Image Export**: html2canvas + Canvas API
- **Drag-and-Drop**: @dnd-kit/core

## Code Conventions
- Use functional components with hooks
- Strict TypeScript (no `any`, explicit return types)
- ESLint + Prettier (run before commit)
- Path aliases: `@/*` for `src/*`

## Feature Implementation Order
1. Auth & User/Team setup
2. Player Registration (FR-1)
3. Pitch Board & Formations (FR-2)
4. Fixtures & RSVPs (FR-3)
5. Lineup Export (FR-4)
6. Match Center & Stats (FR-5)

## Testing
- Unit tests: Vitest
- Integration tests: Supertest
- E2E: Playwright (critical paths only)

## Git Workflow
- Feature branches from `main`
- PR required for all changes
- Squash merge with conventional commits